cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Simulating analogue Hawking radiation with cross-review between two AIs"
abstract: >-
  Numerical solver for analogue Hawking radiation in a 1D Bose-Einstein condensate
  (stationary Bogoliubov-de Gennes, exact modal matching), validated against
  Finazzi and Parentani (2011) and against the exact waterfall results of
  Larré, Recati, Carusotto and Pavloff (2012), with a documented investigation of
  a spurious result caused by an inconsistent background.
authors:
  - family-names: "Torres Ribas"
    given-names: "Jordi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jorditorresribas/bec-analog-hawking"
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
license: [MIT, CC-BY-4.0]
keywords:
  - analogue gravity
  - Hawking radiation
  - Bose-Einstein condensate
  - Bogoliubov-de Gennes
  - reproducibility
